---@field wait_for_events? elasticsearch.TypesWaitForEvents|string Wait until all currently queued events with the given priority are processed.
---@field wait_for_nodes? elasticsearch.ClusterHealthWaitForNodes Wait until the specified number (N) of nodes is available. It also accepts `>=N`, `<=N`, `>N` and `<N`. Alternatively, use the notations `ge(N)`, `le(N)`, `gt(N)`, and `lt(N)`.
