---@field wait_for_completion_timeout? elasticsearch.TypesDuration The period to wait for the request to finish. By default, the request waits for complete query results. If the request completes during the period specified in this parameter, complete query results are returned. Otherwise, the response returns an `is_running` value of `true` and no results.

