---@field included_queries number The number of queries included in the mean recall.
---@field excluded_queries number The number of queries excluded from the mean recall, because the search found a document scoring above the baseline's lowest top `k` score.
---@field took_ms number The time the searches took, in milliseconds.
---@field vector_ops number The number of vector operations of the searches.

