---@field sample_diversity? elasticsearch.GraphTypesSampleDiversity To avoid the top-matching documents sample being dominated by a single source of results, it is sometimes necessary to request diversity in the sample. You can do this by selecting a single-value field and setting a maximum number of documents per value for that field.
