---@field _routing? elasticsearch.TypesMappingRoutingField Enable making a routing value required on indexed documents.
---@field _source? elasticsearch.TypesMappingSourceField Control whether the _source field is enabled on the index.
---@field runtime? elasticsearch.TypesMappingRuntimeFields Mapping of runtime fields for the index.

