---@field inference_id string The inference Id
---@field timeout? elasticsearch.TypesDuration Specifies the amount of time to wait for the inference request to complete.
---@field input elasticsearch.InferenceTextEmbeddingRequestInput Inference input. Either a string or an array of strings.
---@field input_type? string The input data type for the text embedding model. Possible values include: * `SEARCH` * `INGEST` * `CLASSIFICATION` * `CLUSTERING` Not all services support all values. Unsupported values will trigger a validation exception. Accepted values depend on the configured inference service, refer to the relevant service-specific documentation for more info. > info > The `input_type` parameter specified on the root level of the request body will take precedence over the `input_type` parameter specified in `task_settings`.
---@field task_settings? any Task settings for the individual inference request. These settings are specific to the <task_type> you specified and override the task settings specified when initializing the service.

