---@class elasticsearch.InferenceTypesOpenShiftAiServiceSettings
---@field api_key string|distilled.Secret A valid API key for your OpenShift AI endpoint. Can be found in `Token authentication` section of model related information.
---@field url string The URL of the OpenShift AI hosted model endpoint.
---@field model_id? string The name of the model to use for the inference task. Refer to the hosted model's documentation for the name if needed. Service has been tested and confirmed to be working with the following models: * For `text_embedding` task - `gritlm-7b`. * For `completion` and `chat_completion` tasks - `llama-31-8b-instruct`. * For `rerank` task - `bge-reranker-v2-m3`.
---@field max_input_tokens? number For a `text_embedding` task, the maximum number of tokens per input before chunking occurs.
