---@field chunking_settings? elasticsearch.InferenceTypesInferenceChunkingSettings The chunking configuration object. Applies only to the `embedding`, `sparse_embedding` and `text_embedding` task types. Not applicable to the `rerank`, `completion`, or `chat_completion` task types.
