---@field baseline? elasticsearch.GlobalKnnEvalKnnEvalReportedSettings The settings of the baseline search. Not returned when `wait_for_completion` is `false`.
---@field baseline_took_ms? number The time the baseline searches took, in milliseconds. Not returned when `wait_for_completion` is `false`.
---@field baseline_vector_ops? number The number of vector operations of the baseline searches. Not returned when `wait_for_completion` is `false`.
---@field baseline_vector_ops_kind? elasticsearch.GlobalKnnEvalKnnEvalVectorOpsKind What `baseline_vector_ops` counts. Not returned when `wait_for_completion` is `false`.
---@field results? elasticsearch.KnnEval1ResponseResultsList The results of each `knn_settings` entry, in the order of the request. Not returned when `wait_for_completion` is `false`.
---@field failures? elasticsearch.KnnEval1ResponseFailuresMap The queries that failed, by query identifier. Not returned when `wait_for_completion` is `false`.
---@field task? string The identifier of the task that runs the evaluation. Only returned when `wait_for_completion` is `false`.

