---@class elasticsearch.MlDeleteForecast1Request
---@field job_id string Identifier for the anomaly detection job.
---@field forecast_id string A comma-separated list of forecast identifiers. If you do not specify this optional parameter or if you specify `_all` or `*` the API deletes all forecasts from the job.
---@field allow_no_forecasts? boolean Specifies whether an error occurs when there are no forecasts. In particular, if this parameter is set to `false` and there are no forecasts associated with the job, attempts to delete all forecasts return an error.
---@field timeout? elasticsearch.TypesDuration Specifies the period of time to wait for the completion of the delete operation. When this period of time elapses, the API fails and returns an error.

