---@class elasticsearch.MlEstimateModelMemoryRequest
---@field analysis_config? elasticsearch.MlTypesAnalysisConfig For a list of the properties that you can specify in the `analysis_config` component of the body of this API.
---@field max_bucket_cardinality? elasticsearch.MlEstimateModelMemoryRequestMaxBucketCardinalityMap Estimates of the highest cardinality in a single bucket that is observed for influencer fields over the time period that the job analyzes data. To produce a good answer, values must be provided for all influencer fields. Providing values for fields that are not listed as `influencers` has no effect on the estimation.
---@field overall_cardinality? elasticsearch.MlEstimateModelMemoryRequestOverallCardinalityMap Estimates of the cardinality that is observed for fields over the whole time period that the job analyzes data. To produce a good answer, values must be provided for fields referenced in the `by_field_name`, `over_field_name` and `partition_field_name` of any detectors. Providing values for other fields has no effect on the estimation. It can be omitted from the request if no detectors have a `by_field_name`, `over_field_name` or `partition_field_name`.

