---@field description? string A human-readable description of the inference trained model.
---@field inference_config? elasticsearch.MlTypesInferenceConfigCreateContainer The default configuration for inference. This can be either a regression or classification configuration. It must match the underlying definition.trained_model's target_type. For pre-packaged models such as ELSER the config is not required.
