---@alias elasticsearch.MlTypesCategoryPreferredToCategoriesList string[]

---@class elasticsearch.MlTypesChunkingConfig
---@field mode elasticsearch.MlTypesChunkingMode|string If the mode is `auto`, the chunk size is dynamically calculated; this is the recommended value when the datafeed does not use aggregations. If the mode is `manual`, chunking is applied according to the specified `time_span`; use this mode when the datafeed uses aggregations. If the mode is `off`, no chunking is applied.
---@field time_span? elasticsearch.TypesDuration The time span that each search will be querying. This setting is applicable only when the `mode` is set to `manual`.

---@alias elasticsearch.MlTypesChunkingMode "auto"|"manual"|"off"

---@class elasticsearch.MlTypesClassificationInferenceOptions
---@field num_top_classes? number Specifies the number of top class predictions to return. Defaults to 0.
---@field num_top_feature_importance_values? number Specifies the maximum number of feature importance values per document.
---@field prediction_field_type? string Specifies the type of the predicted field to write. Acceptable values are: string, number, boolean. When boolean is provided 1.0 is transformed to true and 0.0 to false.
---@field results_field? string The field that is added to incoming documents to contain the inference prediction. Defaults to predicted_value.
---@field top_classes_results_field? string Specifies the field to which the top classes are written. Defaults to top_classes.

---@alias elasticsearch.MlTypesConditionOperator "gt"|"gte"|"lt"|"lte"

