---@field mse? elasticsearch.MlTypesDataframeEvaluationRegressionMetricsMseMap Average squared difference between the predicted values and the actual (ground truth) value. For more information, read this wiki article.
---@field msle? elasticsearch.MlTypesDataframeEvaluationRegressionMetricsMsle Average squared difference between the logarithm of the predicted values and the logarithm of the actual (ground truth) value.
