---@field conditions? elasticsearch.MlTypesDetectionRuleConditionsList An array of numeric conditions when the rule applies. A rule must either have a non-empty scope or at least one condition. Multiple conditions are combined together with a logical AND.
---@field scope? elasticsearch.MlTypesDetectionRuleScopeMap A scope of series where the rule applies. A rule must either have a non-empty scope or at least one condition. By default, the scope includes all series. Scoping is allowed for any of the fields that are also specified in `by_field_name`, `over_field_name`, or `partition_field_name`.

