---@field include_segment_file_sizes? boolean If true, the call reports the aggregated disk usage of each one of the Lucene index files (only applies if segment stats are requested).
---@field level? elasticsearch.TypesNodeStatsLevel|string Indicates whether statistics are aggregated at the node, indices, or shards level.
---@field timeout? elasticsearch.TypesDuration Period to wait for a response. If no response is received before the timeout expires, the request fails and returns an error.
---@field types? elasticsearch.NodesStatsRequestTypesList A comma-separated list of document types for the indexing index metric.
---@field include_unloaded_segments? boolean If `true`, the response includes information from segments that are not loaded into memory.

