---@field produced_as_first_pipeline_in_bytes number Total number of bytes of all documents produced by the pipeline. The value counts documents for which this pipeline was the first to process them; for pipelines that are not the first to process a document, the value is `0`. In situations where there are subsequent pipelines, the value represents the size of the document after all pipelines have run.

