---
---- `avg`
---- `boxplot`
---- `cardinality`
---- `extended stats`
---- `max`
---- `median absolute deviation`
---- `min`
---- `percentile`
---- `percentile-rank`
---- `stats`
---- `sum`
---- `value count`
---
---The aggregation names can't start with `_mvt_`. The `_mvt_` prefix is reserved for internal aggregations.
---@alias elasticsearch.SearchMvt1RequestAggsMap { [string]: elasticsearch.TypesAggregationsAggregationContainer }

