---@class elasticsearch.SecurityGetApiKeyRequest
---@field id? string An API key id. This parameter cannot be used with any of `name`, `realm_name` or `username`.
---@field name? string An API key name. This parameter cannot be used with any of `id`, `realm_name` or `username`. It supports prefix search with wildcard.
