---@field rare_action_probability number The probability of performing rare actions during the test.
---@field read_node_count number The limit on the number of nodes on which read operations were performed after writing each blob.
---@field repository string The name of the repository that was the subject of the analysis.
---@field seed number The seed for the pseudo-random number generator used to generate the operations used during the test.
