---@field snapshot_verification_concurrency? number The number of snapshots to verify concurrently. The default behavior is to use at most half of the `snapshot_meta` thread pool at once.
---@field verify_blob_contents? boolean Indicates whether to verify the checksum of every data blob in the repository. If this feature is enabled, Elasticsearch will read the entire repository contents, which may be extremely slow and expensive.

