---@field index string A comma-separated list of data streams, indices, and index aliases to search. Wildcard (`*`) expressions are supported. To search all data streams or indices, omit this parameter or use `*` or `_all`.
---@field field string The string to match at the start of indexed terms. If not provided, all terms in the field are considered.
