---@class elasticsearch.TransformPreviewTransformRequest
---@field transform_id string Identifier for the transform to preview. If you specify this path parameter, you cannot provide transform configuration details in the request body.
---@field timeout? elasticsearch.TypesDuration Period to wait for a response. If no response is received before the timeout expires, the request fails and returns an error.
---@field dest? elasticsearch.TransformTypesDestination The destination for the transform.
---@field description? string Free text description of the transform.
---@field frequency? elasticsearch.TypesDuration The interval between checks for changes in the source indices when the transform is running continuously. Also determines the retry interval in the event of transient failures while the transform is searching or indexing. The minimum value is 1s and the maximum is 1h.
---@field pivot? elasticsearch.TransformTypesPivot The pivot method transforms the data by aggregating and grouping it. These objects define the group by fields and the aggregation to reduce the data.
