---@field minimum_should_match? elasticsearch.TypesMinimumShouldMatch Minimum number of clauses that must match for a document to be returned.
---@field phrase_slop? number Maximum number of positions allowed between matching tokens for phrases.
---@field query string Query string you wish to parse and use for search.
