---@field relation? elasticsearch.TypesQueryDslRangeRelation|string Indicates how the range query matches values for `range` fields.
---@field gt? any Greater than.
---@field gte? any Greater than or equal to.
---@field lt? any Less than.
---@field lte? any Less than or equal to.
---@field format? string Date format used to convert `date` values in the query.
---@field time_zone? string Coordinated Universal Time (UTC) offset or IANA time zone used to convert `date` values in the query to UTC.

